+---
+id: task-005-add-booking-cancellation-and-refunds
+type: task
+title: "Add booking cancellation and refunds"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add `cancel(bookingId, at)` to the rental service. It cancels a booking once and returns its ID and
+refund in integer euro cents. Refund the unused fraction of the booking's charged total, rounded to
+the nearest cent; clamp cancellation before the booking to a full refund and cancellation after its
+end to zero. The cancellation immediately releases the equipment for new bookings and availability
+queries. Validate the booking ID and cancellation timestamp, and document the public API and refund
+policy.
